msgstr "(C) 2006 - 2007 Mirco \"MacSlow\" Müller"

#: ../glade/cairo-clock.glade.h:1.5
msgid "A 20th anniversary GTK4 port by Evan Slower\nof MacSlow's super fine Cairo-based analog clock"
msgstr "Et GTK4-port til 20-års jubilæet af Evan Slower\naf MacSlows super fine Cairo-baserede analoge ur"

